{"text": "Near the village lived a lady, a small landowner, who owned about three hundred acres. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She hired an old soldier as her manager, who fined the peasants whenever their animals wandered onto her fields. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Pahom paid many fines, and each time he went home in a bad temper, shouting at his family. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then the news came that the lady wanted to sell her land, and the peasants all wished to buy some. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Because the Devil made them quarrel, they could not buy it together, so each man bought what he could. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Pahom sold a colt and half of his bees, borrowed money from his brother in law, and bought forty acres. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Pahom was full of joy on the day when he first plowed his own fields, and even the grass looked different. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But soon the neighbors cattle began to stray into his meadows, and Pahom began to take their owners to court. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Once he had been the poor man who paid fines, but now he was the one who made others pay. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> His neighbors grew angry, and when someone cut down his lime trees, Pahom blamed a peasant named Simon without any proof.", "alignment": {"characters": ["N", "e", "a", "r", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "v", "i", "l", "l", "a", "g", "e", " ", "l", "i", "v", "e", "d", " ", "a", " ", "l", "a", "d", "y", ",", " ", "a", " ", "s", "m", "a", "l", "l", " ", "l", "a", "n", "d", "o", "w", "n", "e", "r", ",", " ", "w", "h", "o", " ", "o", "w", "n", "e", "d", " ", "a", "b", "o", "u", "t", " ", "t", "h", "r", "e", "e", " ", "h", "u", "n", "d", "r", "e", "d", " ", "a", "c", "r", "e", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "h", "e", " ", "h", "i", "r", "e", "d", " ", "a", "n", " ", "o", "l", "d", " ", "s", "o", "l", "d", "i", "e", "r", " ", "a", "s", " ", "h", "e", "r", " ", "m", "a", 